## Constraints And Defaults

- Keep this work local to `image-tagger`; do not write to Knowledge Atlas or upstream contractor repos.
- Treat `_archive/` as reference only.
- Do not introduce a new standalone HTML viewer.
- Do not add heavyweight ML dependencies for v1 latent detectors.
- Keep proxy detectors transparent and evidence-rich.
- Use existing auth boundaries: Explorer public, Admin/Workbench/Monitor protected.
- Update `docs/CONTRACT.md` when endpoint shapes or shared response types change.
- If implementation changes canonical science config, bump `ACTIVE_SCIENCE_VERSION` so old runs are not silently treated as current.

